1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Where were you on Saturday?
Thứ Bảy bạn ở đâu?

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,839
I was at the park.
Mình ở công viên.

3
00:00:05,839 --> 00:00:07,459
When were you there?
Bạn ở đó khi nào?

4
00:00:07,459 --> 00:00:10,019
I was there in the afternoon.
Mình ở đó vào buổi chiều.

5
00:00:10,019 --> 00:00:11,939
Who were you with?
Bạn đi với ai?

6
00:00:11,939 --> 00:00:17,379
I was with my aunt, uncle and cousins.
Mình đi với dì, chú và các anh chị em họ.

7
00:00:17,379 --> 00:00:19,500
What was the weather like?
Thời tiết thế nào?

8
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:20,379
It was sunny.
Trời nắng.
